 the segment writes, like\n831:  and its **store footprint** (store keys and effect kinds its handlers may\n835:  under-approximation. A module effect handler may read store keys the\n846:### 7.6.2 The store slice, restored as an isolated store\n850:continuation carries the **reachable slice**: every store key the fixed\n1066:UCF therefore defines an explicit **exporting** transition that precedes\n1305:| No implicit control flow | Resume happens only at a safepoint the machine's parking transitions define; the successor chain is explicit `:yin.k/origin` links; the exporting state is an observed data state, never a notification. |\n1365:  pending definition (a define continuation awaiting its value), stamp\n1368:  parked definition are M4 obligations and do not pass today.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
